          "Address housing affordability directly: at $105K+ income and 64% renter rate in an urban market, young professionals in this district are spending a significant portion of income on housing; an incumbent who does not prioritize rent control, affordable housing development, and tenant legal protections is vulnerable to a challenger who does.",
