          "Prepare for primary vulnerability despite the unopposed 2024 result: a 57.85% Black district at 100% Democratic performance with no organized opposition is not a sign of electoral safety—it is a sign of current opposition weakness or low engagement. Any incumbent should assume a credible primary challenger could emerge by the next cycle, and should build a record of constituent service and visible governance achievement that would withstand primary scrutiny."
