          "Engage the Black-majority constituency with governance specificity: at 51.69% of the district, Black constituents are not a demographic descriptor but the foundation of the representative's electoral coalition; authentic engagement on issues like criminal justice reform, equitable economic development, and community safety is both a governance obligation and an electoral prerequisite.",
          "Treat the 73% as a working mandate, not a safe harbor: this margin is conditional on delivering material improvements in economic security for renters and working families; any representative who assumes the 73% will hold without active constituent engagement and visible policy results is miscalculating the durability of this coalition."
