          "Build active relationship with Hispanic community economic concerns: at 52.75% Hispanic, this is the district's demographic majority, and engagement must be specific—workforce development, immigrant family economic security, language access in services, and whether neighborhood investment is real—not tokenistic acknowledgment.",
