          "Lead with the shared professional and educational experience that binds a diverse (63.54% white, 16.88% Asian, 10.47% Hispanic, 5.07% Black) constituency together: quality schools, professional-opportunity pathways, institutional stability, and responsive local governance that reflects high constituent expectations for sophisticated representation.",
          "Develop a specific governance agenda around local schools, housing affordability at professional-class income levels, and infrastructure investment that demonstrates that Democratic representation in HD-41 delivers concrete results—not merely occupies the seat unopposed."
