          "Maintain visibility on education quality and property values—the two material concerns that bind together a 31.9% college-educated, $97,556 median income, 79.2% homeowner constituency; these are not ideological issues but direct household financial concerns that require concrete legislative attention.",
          "Treat the unopposed status as a strategic vulnerability rather than an asset: prepare for the possibility that a credible Democratic challenger could emerge if the seat is taken for granted; maintain constituent contact, communicate legislative accomplishments, and monitor whether new demographic groups entering the district feel represented or ignored."
