          "Deliver visible results on working-class economic mobility: 17.2% college attainment and $74,634 median income signal a workforce-dependent constituency for whom job access, wage growth, and credential pathways are the primary evaluation criteria; legislative record must show tangible action on apprenticeships, small business support, and living wage advocacy rather than abstract economic positioning.",
