          "Do not assume Democratic unopposed status reflects durable dominance: a 100% result suggests Republican organizational absence rather than Democratic invulnerability — any incumbent or challenger who treats this as a safe seat and neglects specific policy delivery to the renter and educated workforce majority risks sudden competitive vulnerability."
